id: pmc-y7al
title: Converge the pinned pm-cli on 2026.8.31 and repair history hashes
description: "Bump the pinned @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency from 2026.8.20 to 2026.8.31 (exact pin), run pm history-repair --all to re-anchor the history chain under the new hash computation, and remove stale merge-receipt stubs that the newer binary flags as merge_receipts_pending. The fleet converges on 2026.8.31 so every repo agrees. Upstream cause: pm-cli#1168 (history-hash computation changed between 2026.8.22 and 2026.8.24)."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
